{
  "language": "en",
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.7,
      "text": "Hey, Co, what are your thoughts on the Hassan and Onepixel situation?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.7,
      "end": 11.9,
      "text": "You know, I'm really glad that you did somebody ask this."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.9,
      "end": 12.9,
      "text": "So, um..."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.7,
      "end": 21.7,
      "text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.7,
      "end": 22.7,
      "text": "That went out to Cam."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.7,
      "end": 24.7,
      "text": "We had a lot of space testing on his forehead."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.7,
      "end": 26.7,
      "text": "There was security in the place, ain't shit."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.7,
      "end": 28.7,
      "text": "I'ma talk to him."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.7,
      "end": 30.7,
      "text": "Very good!"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 31.7,
      "text": "Hey, hold up, hold up."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.7,
      "end": 32.7,
      "text": "Y'all on the guest list?"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.7,
      "end": 33.7,
      "text": "Nah."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.7,
      "end": 34.7,
      "text": "Downplay up there."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.7,
      "end": 35.7,
      "text": "Hey, that's cool."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.7,
      "end": 37.7,
      "text": "Bruh, you know what these people be like, man?"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.7,
      "end": 39.7,
      "text": "I can only let people in on the guest list."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.7,
      "end": 40.7,
      "text": "I ain't trying to lose my job."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.7,
      "end": 43.7,
      "text": "Look, man, my dog just won a little autograph or something like that."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.7,
      "end": 44.7,
      "text": "You feel me?"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.7,
      "end": 45.7,
      "text": "Gotta get your name on the list."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.7,
      "end": 46.7,
      "text": "Ain't nothing I could do."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.7,
      "end": 47.7,
      "text": "Okay, okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.7,
      "end": 50.3,
      "text": "For show."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.3,
      "end": 53.8,
      "text": "But anyway, I know it's kind of a hot take, but, um, that's kind of how I fundamentally"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.8,
      "end": 56.8,
      "text": "feel about it."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.8,
      "end": 57.8,
      "text": "Hey, I know what..."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.8,
      "end": 58.8,
      "text": "Hey, you little..."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.8,
      "end": 59.8,
      "text": "I just got these for my cousin."
    }
  ]
}